      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُؤْلُوكٌ</span></b>  <i>A case,</i> or <i>an affair, of great magnitude,</i> or <i>gravity,</i> or <i>moment:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَآلِيكُ</span>. (Ibn-
'Abbád, K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرَكْتُهُمْ فِى دُؤْلُوكٍ</span> [<i>I left
them in,</i> or <i>engaged in, a case,</i> or <i>an affair, of
great magnitude,</i> &amp;c.]. (TA.) ＝   
